A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular video game series and media franchise '''Sonic the Hedgehog''' (ソニック・ザ・ヘッジホッグ, ''Sonikku Za Hejjihoggu'', '''Sonic the Hedgehog''') was originally held from May 23rd, 2025 to June 5th, 2025. The collaboration includes an [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Rare Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The franchise is owned by [[wikipedia:Sega|Sega]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Sonic the Hedgehog'''}} comes to The Battle Cats for a special crossover event!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between August 4th (11:00am) and August 18th (11:00am)!'''}}

・Sonic the Hedgehog Collab Capsules'''}}<br>
Limited heroes join The Battle Cats cast in a collab-only "Sonic the Hedgehog" Rare Capsule set!<br>
Sonic, Shadow and other awesome heroes sent to aid the Cats by divine powers are only available during this event!

Collab-exclusive heroes include:<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Sonic (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Cool and spiky hedgehog who runs at supersonic speed.<br>
Delivers massive damage along with guaranteed Knockback and Slow to Angel enemies!<br>
{{Color|#FBBC04|'''Tails (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Kind-hearted young fox with a pair of tails.<br>
Inflicts debuffs on Red and Aliens with Explosion attacks!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Knuckles (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
One punch from this echidna can pulverize a boulder.<br>
Strong against Red and Zombie enemies!<br>
{{Color|#A02B93|'''Shadow (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Black hedgehog who's almost like Sonic's double!<br>
Massive damage to Black and Zombie enemies!<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Shadow Cat (Rare)'''}}<br>
Tough against Metal enemies!

※The characters listed above appear at a fixed rate from draws made on this set during this event, alongside regularly available Rare and Super Rare heroes.<br>
※ Sonic the Hedgehog units above will not be available from Capsule events outside of this this limited collab set.<br>
※ You must update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats to access the Sonic the Hedgehog limited Capsule event.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stages Added!'''}}<br>
Divine powers have sent supersonic heroes to the world of The Battle Cats!<br>
Sonic and team appear as powerful enemies in limited stages only appearing during this collab event!

Visit the Legend Stages to take on these challenges during the collab event!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Collab Map: "Green Hill Zone"'''}}<br>
Go head-to-head against the hedgehog speedster Sonic in special stages!<br>
Earn Victory on any stage in this map during the collab event for a small chance to unlock Sonic Cat upon Victory, with<br>
higher-difficulty stages later in the map giving you better chances to receive Sonic Cat as a drop reward!

Plus, a Victory on any stage will grant a small chance to access the extra stage, {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''"Bonus Stage"'''}}, offering awesome XP rewards!

※ Use a Treasure Radar on these stages for a guaranteed chance collect Sonic Cat upon victory.<br>
※ Activate "Sonic Cat" by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Collab Map: "Chemical Plant Zone"'''}}<br>
Face off against Sonic's adorable sidekick Tails in these special stages!<br>
Earn rewards like {{Color|#4EA72E|'''useful battle items'''}} or a {{Color|#4EA72E|'''Rare Ticket'''}} based on your score when clearing a stage!

Plus, a Victory on any stage will grant a small chance to access the extra stage, {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''"Bonus Stage"'''}}, offering awesome XP rewards!

※Check the Timed Score Reward in the bottom left of the stage select screen to check the rewards for clearing stages.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Collab Map: "Sky Sanctuary" from Day 4'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On Day 4 of the collab event (August 7th from 11:00AM)'''}}, Sonic's battle buddy Knuckles arrives to challenge your Cats in limited stages!

Earn piles of XP to empower your Cat Army by taking on these stages over and over during the collab event!

Plus, a Victory on any stage will grant a small chance to access the extra stage, {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''"Bonus Stage"'''}}, offering awesome XP rewards!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Collab Map: "Radical Highway" from Day 8'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On Day 8 of the collab event (August 11th from 11:00AM)'''}}, the ultimate lifeform Shadow the Hedgehog comes to challenge your Cats in a series of thrilling Gauntlet Stages!

The Chaos Spear grows stronger with each battle... Can you clear all 20 tough stages and earn every reward on offer?

※ After clearing a stage, there will be a short cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A will allow you to skip the stage cooldown period and challenge the next stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Arena of Honor Map: "Sonic Battle!"'''}}<br>
Face off against Sonic and team in a relentless battle at the ranking stages!<br>
Visit the Catclaw Dojo to access the Arena of Honor stage {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''"Sonic Battle"'''}} to take on the challenge!

Can you get a high score that makes it into the top 10% of Cat Battlers as you pit your score against players from around the world?<br>
Once the event is over, your score will earn you awesome rewards depending on what rank you have earned! The higher the tier you reach, the bigger and better the payoff!<br>
Check out what you might get by tapping the Rewards List button at the top right of the Dojo menu screen!

※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but it may take a short while after the end of this event before your rewards are delivered. Thank you for your patience!<br>
※ Rewards must be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from The Battle Cats title menu.<br>
※ Rewards in the Mailbox will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ You must be connected to an online network to have your score recorded. Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Dojo event scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Arena of Honor Ranking Events will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1<br>
※ If Dojo events do not appear, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Gamatoto Expeditions Event!'''}}<br>
Only during this event, get extra support on your Gamatoto expeditions as {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''Chao'''}} joins the crew for a limited time!<br>
This collab event-only ally will help your Gamatoto team earn more XP and useful battle items, so don't miss out on this chance!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Special Sonic the Hedgehog collab event missions appear to offer awesome rewards for your achievements!<br>
Visit the Catnip Challenges at the Missions tab during the event to learn more!

※Rewards from Special Missions during the limited-time event must be claimed before August 18th, 2025 (10:59AM) or the rewards will be lost.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Get a Rare Ticket and Item Rewards from Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Collect another limited login stamps each day you log in to The Battle Cats, with each stamp including special rewards like battle items, and Special unit {{Color|#FF9900|'''"Tails Cat"'''}} with your fifth stamp!

※Activate "Tails Cat" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※There are 14 stamps available during this event.

To learn more about Sonic the Hedgehog, visit:<br>
[https://sonic.sega.jp/SonicChannel/index.html Official Sonic Portal Site: SONIC CHANNEL]

